  "id": "tax.us.2025.rule.w2-box6-total",
  "notes": "W-2 box 6 total for Schedule 8812 line 21 (Part II-B). Publishes only when the number of box-6 statements equals the number of box-1 statements ($0 is a valid answer); a box-1 W-2 without its box-6 answer raises DEPENDENCY_ABSENT naming tax.us.2025.w2.box6-medicare. Read only on the Part II-B path. Read only when Schedule 8812 Part II-B is needed (the when is evaluated first; a count or box answer is read only on that path). Core v66 (itemization-cents, Track 4): this subtotal no longer rounds. It publishes the sum with cents; the line that adds it rounds the total once (i1040gi-2025 'Rounding Off to Whole Dollars': include cents when adding amounts and round off only the total). Its guards are unchanged.",
